window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-876504b8e83a1d66"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"review-github-pull-requests\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"github\">审查 GitHub 拉取请求</h1> <p>在人工评审前发现回归和潜在问题。</p> <p>使用 GitHub 中的 Codex 代码审查，自动在拉取请求上指出回归问题、缺少的测试和文档问题。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>希望在人工合并批准前再增加一道审查信号的团队。</li> <li>生产环境中的大型代码库项目。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/security-best-practices\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">$security-best-practices（需联网）</a></td> <td>重点检查密钥、身份验证和依赖项变更等高风险区域。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">起步提示词</h2> <p>请 Codex 审查拉取请求</p> <p>建议模型：<code>cloud</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@codex review，检查安全回归、缺失测试和高风险行为变更。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ba7354e174823641\">在 GitHub 中使用 Codex 代码审查</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-94f17e3de1ca7cb3\">使用 AGENTS.md 编写自定义指令</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"how-to-use\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">使用方法</h2> <p>先在 GitHub 组织或代码库中添加 Codex 代码审查。更多详情请参阅<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/third-party/github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在 GitHub 中使用 Codex 代码审查（本地尚未收录）</a>。</p> <p>你可以设置 Codex 自动审查每个拉取请求，也可以在拉取请求评论中发送 <code>@codex review</code> 来请求审查。</p> <p>如果 Codex 标记了回归或潜在问题，可以在拉取请求中评论 <code>@codex fix it</code> 这样的后续提示词，请它修复问题。</p> <p>这会启动一个新的云端聊天来修复问题，并更新拉取请求。</p> <p><a id=\"define-review-guidance\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">定义审查指导</h2> <p>要自定义 Codex 审查的内容，请在最靠近受规则约束代码的 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 中添加 <code>## Code Review Rules</code> 章节。例如：</p> <pre><code class=\"language-md\">## Code Review Rules\n\n### Experiment cohorts\n\n- Do not filter treatment comparisons on post-exposure behavior, including conversion or retention.\n  Safe path: build cohorts from assignment or exposure; report conversion as an outcome.\n</code></pre> <p>将整个仓库通用的规则放在根目录的 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 中，将服务专属规则放在嵌套文件中。规则应简短，说明要标记的行为以及安全路径或例外；格式和 lint 检查则交给 CI。有关设置和规则编写的指导，请参阅<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/third-party/github#customize-what-codex-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">自定义 Codex 代码审查内容</a>（官网章节，需联网） <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/third-party/github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本地页面（本地尚未收录）</a>。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"review-github-pull-requests\">Review GitHub pull requests</h1> <p>Catch regressions and potential issues before human review.</p> <p>Use Codex code review in GitHub to automatically surface regressions, missing tests, and documentation issues directly on a pull request.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Teams that want another review signal before human merge approval</li> <li>Large codebases for projects in production</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/security-best-practices\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">$security-best-practices (online)</a></td> <td>Focus the review on risky surfaces such as secrets, auth, and dependency changes.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Ask Codex to review a pull request</p> <p>Suggested model：<code>cloud</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@codex review for security regressions, missing tests, and risky behavior changes.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-ba7354e174823641\">Codex code review in GitHub</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-94f17e3de1ca7cb3\">Custom instructions with AGENTS.md</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"how-to-use\">How to use</h2> <p>Start by adding Codex code review to your GitHub organization or repository. See <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/third-party/github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Codex code review in GitHub (not in this local snapshot)</a> for more details.</p> <p>You can set up Codex to automatically review every pull request, or you can request a review with <code>@codex review</code> in a pull request comment.</p> <p>If Codex flags a regression or potential issue, you can ask it to fix it by commenting on the pull request with a follow-up prompt like <code>@codex fix it</code>.</p> <p>This will start a new cloud chat that will fix the issue and update the pull request.</p> <h2 id=\"define-review-guidance\">Define review guidance</h2> <p>To customize what Codex reviews, add a <code>## Code Review Rules</code> section to the <code>AGENTS.md</code> closest to the code the rules govern. For example:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-md\">## Code Review Rules\n\n### Experiment cohorts\n\n- Do not filter treatment comparisons on post-exposure behavior, including conversion or retention.\n  Safe path: build cohorts from assignment or exposure; report conversion as an outcome.\n</code></pre> <p>Put repository-wide rules in the root <code>AGENTS.md</code> and service-specific rules in a nested file. Keep rules concise, describe the behavior to flag and any safe path or exception, and leave formatting and lint checks in CI. See <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/third-party/github#customize-what-codex-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Customize what Codex reviews</a> (official section, online) <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/third-party/github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Local page (not in this local snapshot)</a> for setup and rule-writing guidance.</p>"};
